flowchart TB
  subgraph Loop[Event loop thread]
    T1[Task: tool A]
    T2[Task: tool B]
    T3[Task: tool C]
    Sched[Scheduler]
  end

  subgraph Wait[Waiting off-CPU]
    Net[Network I/O]
  end

  subgraph Offload[Optional]
    Pool[Thread pool for blocking/CPU]
  end

  Sched --> T1
  Sched --> T2
  Sched --> T3
  T1 -->|await| Net
  T2 -->|await| Net
  T3 -->|await to_thread| Pool
  Net -->|ready| Sched
  Pool -->|done| Sched
